#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003af92d/0xb26e10/0x000002
msgid ""
"The only reason \n"
"we've been able to keep on fighting..."
msgstr ""
"我们之所以\n"
"能一直战斗下去……"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003af92d/0xb26e10/0x000003
msgid "Amanda?"
msgstr "阿曼达？"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003af92d/0xb26e10/0x000004
msgid "The factory... You saw it?"
msgstr "那个工厂……你看到了？"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003af92d/0xb26e10/0x000005
msgid "The banana factory..."
msgstr "香蕉工厂……"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003af952/0x326e85/0x000000
#: slot/0x00a57090/0x12908e/0x000266
msgid "Curses!"
msgstr "可恶！"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003af96d/0x396f96/0x000000
msgid "Wh... who's there...?"
msgstr "谁……谁在那儿……？"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003af96d/0x396f96/0x000001
msgid "Chico? It's me."
msgstr "奇科？是我。"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003af96d/0x396f96/0x000002
msgid "You're..."
msgstr "你是……"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003af96d/0x396f96/0x000003
msgid "You're that... photographer?"
msgstr "你是那……摄影师？"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003af96d/0x396f96/0x000004
msgid "That's right, a war photographer."
msgstr "没错，战地摄影师。"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003af96d/0x396f96/0x000005
msgid "Huh? I thought you were here for the birds."
msgstr "咦？我还以为你是来拍鸟的。"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003af96d/0x396f96/0x000006
msgid "Yeah, uh, the birds of the battlefield."
msgstr "对，呃，战场上的鸟。"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003af96d/0x396f96/0x000007
msgid "Whoa, is that... Che's?"
msgstr "哇，那是……切的东西？"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003af96d/0x396f96/0x000008
msgid "Can I see it?"
msgstr "能让我看看吗？"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003af96d/0x396f96/0x000009
msgid "Wow! The same kind el Che used!"
msgstr "哇！和切用的一样！"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003af96d/0x396f96/0x00000a
msgid "You can't keep it, kid. Here, have these instead."
msgstr "小子，这不能给你。来，这些给你。"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003af96d/0x396f96/0x00000b
msgid "Those photos?"
msgstr "那些照片？"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003af96d/0x396f96/0x00000c
msgid "Oh no... Amanda!"
msgstr "糟了……阿曼达！"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003af96d/0x396f96/0x00000d
msgid "She's safe. Don't worry."
msgstr "她没事。别担心。"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003af96d/0x396f96/0x00000e
#: slot/0x0083b291/0xff8cbc/0x44a048
msgid "Are you sure?"
msgstr "你确定？"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003af96d/0x396f96/0x00000f
msgid "We're patching her up back at my place."
msgstr "我们正在我那儿给她包扎。"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003af96d/0x396f96/0x000010
msgid "She's hurt?!"
msgstr "她受伤了？！"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003af96d/0x396f96/0x000011
msgid "...I said don't worry. It's just a broken leg."
msgstr "……我说了别担心。只是腿断了。"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003af96d/0x396f96/0x000012
msgid "...You got any cigarettes?"
msgstr "……你有烟吗？"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003af96d/0x396f96/0x000013
msgid "A cigar, huh..."
msgstr "雪茄，是吧……"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003af96d/0x396f96/0x000014
#: slot/0x00420130/0x649bfd/0x000000
#: slot/0x00a57090/0x12908e/0x000183
msgid "Hey!"
msgstr "喂！"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003af96d/0x396f96/0x000015
msgid "It's not for kids."
msgstr "这不是小孩子该知道的。"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003af96d/0x396f96/0x000016
msgid "Chico, do you know where they took the cargo?"
msgstr "奇科，他们把货运哪了？"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003af96d/0x396f96/0x000017
msgid "Cargo? What cargo?"
msgstr "货物？什么货物？"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003af96d/0x396f96/0x000018
msgid ""
"...Let me rephrase that. \n"
"How do they get stuff from the coast up here?"
msgstr ""
"……换个问法。\n"
"他们怎么把东西从海岸运上来？"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003af96d/0x396f96/0x000019
msgid "Oh, that I can tell you."
msgstr "哦，这我能说。"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003af96d/0x396f96/0x00001a
msgid ""
"When the cargo gets to the harbor, \n"
"they first send it up the marshes on a barge."
msgstr ""
"货物到了港口后，\n"
"先用驳船沿沼泽运上来。"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003af96d/0x396f96/0x00001b
msgid ""
"Then they load it onto a jungle train \n"
"past the banana plantation"
msgstr ""
"然后装上丛林列车，\n"
"穿过香蕉种植园"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003af96d/0x396f96/0x00001c
msgid "and transport it by rail."
msgstr "再经铁路运输。"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003af96d/0x396f96/0x00001d
msgid ""
"The train stops here. When it gets to \n"
"the train terminal past the coffee plantation, "
msgstr ""
"列车停在这里。等它开到\n"
"咖啡种植园那边的终点站，"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003af96d/0x396f96/0x00001e
msgid "they reload it again, this time onto a truck "
msgstr "他们又换一次车，这次装上卡车"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003af96d/0x396f96/0x00001f
msgid "which disappears into a tunnel heading toward the mountains."
msgstr "卡车就消失在通往山里的隧道中。"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003af96d/0x396f96/0x000020
msgid "Disappears?"
msgstr "消失？"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003af96d/0x396f96/0x000021
msgid "Chico, what's on the other side of that tunnel?"
msgstr "奇科，那条隧道另一头是什么？"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003af96d/0x396f96/0x000022
msgid ""
"Nobody knows.\n"
"None of our compas ever got close enough..."
msgstr ""
"没人知道。\n"
"我们的人从没靠近过……"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003af96d/0x396f96/0x000023
msgid "It's protected by a spirit."
msgstr "那里有恶灵守护。"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003af96d/0x396f96/0x000024
msgid "...A spirit."
msgstr "……恶灵。"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003af96d/0x396f96/0x000025
msgid "Yeah. A giant monster."
msgstr "对。一只巨怪。"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003af96d/0x396f96/0x000026
msgid "...El basilisco."
msgstr "……蛇怪。"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003af96d/0x396f96/0x000027
msgid "The king of snakes...?"
msgstr "蛇中之王……？"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003af96d/0x396f96/0x000028
msgid ""
"No, no, no, really, I saw it! \n"
"I was camping up there one day, "
msgstr ""
"不不不，真的，我见过！\n"
"有天我在上面露营，"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003af96d/0x396f96/0x000029
msgid ""
"and just as I was waking up around dawn, \n"
"I heard this loud noise."
msgstr ""
"黎明时刚醒过来，\n"
"就听到一声巨响。"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003af96d/0x396f96/0x00002a
msgid "I opened my eyes and saw an enormous shadow."
msgstr "我睁眼看到个巨影。"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003af96d/0x396f96/0x00002b
msgid "Must have been 30 vara (80 ft) at least."
msgstr "至少有30巴拉（80英尺）。"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003af96d/0x396f96/0x00002c
msgid "...It was walking. On legs as big as trees."
msgstr "……它在走。腿跟树一样粗。"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003af96d/0x396f96/0x00002d
msgid "Where did you see it?"
msgstr "你在哪看到的？"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003af96d/0x396f96/0x00002e
msgid ""
"At the terminal near the tunnel. \n"
"But I only saw it that one time."
msgstr ""
"在隧道附近的终端。\n"
"但我只见过那一次。"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003af96d/0x396f96/0x00002f
msgid "What exactly were you doing there?"
msgstr "你在那里到底做什么？"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003af96d/0x396f96/0x000030
msgid "I, uh... Well, me and my sister got into a fight."
msgstr "我，呃……我和我姐姐吵了一架。"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003af96d/0x396f96/0x000031
msgid "And you just \"happened\" to go camping?"
msgstr "你就“碰巧”去露营？"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003af96d/0x396f96/0x000032
msgid "You know, "
msgstr "你知道，"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003af96d/0x396f96/0x000033
msgid ""
"their train should be arriving at the place \n"
"I saw el basilisco right about now!"
msgstr ""
"他们的火车现在应该快到\n"
"我看到el basilisco的地方了！"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003af96d/0x396f96/0x000034
msgid "Is it far?"
msgstr "远吗？"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003af96d/0x396f96/0x000035
msgid ""
"Not really. Go past the coffee plantation \n"
"and it'll be to the north."
msgstr ""
"不算远。过了咖啡种植园，\n"
"就在北边。"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003af96d/0x396f96/0x000036
msgid "What are you chasing?"
msgstr "你在追什么？"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003af96d/0x396f96/0x000037
msgid ""
"Something that could keep the world \n"
"in balance... or destroy it."
msgstr ""
"能维持世界平衡……\n"
"也能毁灭世界的东西。"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003af96d/0x396f96/0x000039
msgid ""
"I heard that place was a narcotics plant \n"
"before those guys took it over. "
msgstr ""
"我听说那地方在那些人接手前\n"
"是个毒品工厂。"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003af96d/0x396f96/0x00003a
msgid "But, you already knew that, didn't you."
msgstr "不过，你早就知道了，对吧。"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003af96d/0x396f96/0x00003b
msgid ""
"Look, I get it. \n"
"Even revolutionaries need to pay the bills."
msgstr ""
"听着，我明白。\n"
"革命者也得付账单。"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003af96d/0x396f96/0x00003c
msgid "Still, must be tough for a kid like you to swallow."
msgstr "不过，你这种孩子还是很难接受吧。"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003af96d/0x396f96/0x00003d
msgid ""
"You're damn right it is!\n"
"The route they use to transport stuff "
msgstr ""
"你说得没错！\n"
"他们运货的路线"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003af96d/0x396f96/0x00003e
msgid "is the same one mi viejo used to smuggle drugs."
msgstr "就是mi viejo以前走私毒品的路线。"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003af96d/0x396f96/0x00003f
msgid "They sold the drugs to the norteamericanos "
msgstr "他们把毒品卖给norteamericanos，"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003af96d/0x396f96/0x000040
msgid "and used the profits to fund the army."
msgstr "用赚来的钱供养军队。"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003af96d/0x396f96/0x000041
msgid "They tried to keep it hidden from me."
msgstr "他们想瞒着我。"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003af96d/0x396f96/0x000042
msgid "Is that why you went \"camping\"?"
msgstr "所以你去“露营”了？"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003af96d/0x396f96/0x000043
msgid "Yes..."
msgstr "是的……"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003af96d/0x396f96/0x000044
msgid ""
"I managed to sneak into the plant \n"
"a few times and..."
msgstr ""
"我设法溜进了工厂\n"
"几次，然后……"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003af96d/0x396f96/0x000045
msgid "...I tried to set it on fire."
msgstr "……我想烧了它。"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003af96d/0x396f96/0x000046
msgid "...Everyone treats me like a child."
msgstr "……大家都把我当小孩。"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003af96d/0x396f96/0x000047
msgid ""
"I, I, I couldn't stand it anymore. \n"
"I'm not a kid. I'm twelve! "
msgstr ""
"我，我，我再也受不了了。\n"
"我不是小孩。我都十二岁了！"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003af96d/0x396f96/0x000048
msgid "Couldn't do it though, could you?"
msgstr "可你做不到，对吧？"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003af96d/0x396f96/0x000049
msgid ""
"Chico, growing up means choosing how you're\n"
"gonna live your life."
msgstr ""
"奇科，长大就是选择自己要怎样\n"
"度过一生。"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003af96d/0x396f96/0x00004a
msgid "To do the right thing,"
msgstr "要做正确的事，"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003af96d/0x396f96/0x00004b
msgid ""
"you sometimes have to leave the things \n"
"you care about behind"
msgstr ""
"有时你不得不舍弃\n"
"你所珍视之物"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003af96d/0x396f96/0x00004c
msgid "parents, family, your homeland."
msgstr "父母、家人、故乡。"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003af96d/0x396f96/0x00004d
msgid "But mi viejo..."
msgstr "可我的老爹……"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003af96d/0x396f96/0x00004e
msgid "Papá..."
msgstr "爸爸……"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003af96d/0x396f96/0x00004f
msgid "Chico...Look at the photos."
msgstr "奇科……看照片。"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003af96d/0x396f96/0x000051
msgid "Treasure your memories, Chico. "
msgstr "珍惜你的回忆，奇科。"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003af96d/0x396f96/0x000052
msgid "No matter what happens, keep them safe."
msgstr "不管怎样，护好它们。"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003af96d/0x396f96/0x000053
msgid "You wanna get out of here, Chico?"
msgstr "你想离开这里吗，奇科？"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003af96d/0x396f96/0x000054
msgid "I do but... "
msgstr "想，可是……"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003af96d/0x396f96/0x000055
msgid "Come back with me. Your sister's waiting for you."
msgstr "跟我回去吧。你姐姐在等你。"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003af96d/0x396f96/0x000056
msgid "I can't go back... I can't face everybody..."
msgstr "我回不去……没脸见人……"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003af96d/0x396f96/0x000057
msgid "...You told them where your compas are?"
msgstr "……你供出了你的同伴？"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003af96d/0x396f96/0x000059
msgid ""
"Nothing to be ashamed of.\n"
"Pain gets the better of us all."
msgstr ""
"没什么好羞耻的。\n"
"痛苦谁都扛不住。"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003af96d/0x396f96/0x00005a
msgid "...I wish I was dead."
msgstr "……我真希望自己死了。"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003af96d/0x396f96/0x00005b
msgid "OK, then, I'll put you out of your misery."
msgstr "好，那我就让你解脱。"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003af96d/0x396f96/0x00005c
msgid "Wha-?!"
msgstr "什么？！"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003af96d/0x396f96/0x00005d
msgid "Any last words?"
msgstr "有什么遗言吗？"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003af96d/0x396f96/0x00005e
msgid "\"Shoot, you are only going to kill a man.\""
msgstr "“开枪吧，你不过杀一个人。”"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003af96d/0x396f96/0x00005f
msgid "I just wasted a bullet. Don't waste your life."
msgstr "我只浪费一颗子弹。别浪费命。"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003af96d/0x396f96/0x000060
msgid ""
"Listen to me, Chico. You died here today.\n"
"You understand?"
msgstr ""
"听我说，奇科。你今天死在这了。\n"
"懂吗？"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003af96d/0x396f96/0x000061
msgid ""
"You're hombre nuevo. A new man.\n"
"Now, give that new life to me."
msgstr ""
"你是新人。全新的人。\n"
"把新命交给我。"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003af96d/0x396f96/0x000062
msgid ""
"Fight with me, little soldier.\n"
"Show me how strong you really are."
msgstr ""
"跟我打，小士兵。\n"
"让我看看你多强。"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003af96d/0x396f96/0x000063
msgid "Dry your tears, then promise me one thing."
msgstr "擦干眼泪，然后答应我一件事。"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003af96d/0x396f96/0x000064
msgid "No smoking until you get older."
msgstr "长大之前不许抽烟。"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003af96d/0x396f96/0x000065
msgid ""
"Remember, real heroes are never as polished \n"
"as the legends that surround them."
msgstr ""
"记住，真正的英雄从来不像\n"
"围绕他们的传说那样完美。"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003af96d/0x396f96/0x000066
msgid "You got it, Boss."
msgstr "明白，BOSS。"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003af96d/0x396f96/0x000067
msgid "Snake is fine."
msgstr "叫我SNAKE就行。"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003af96d/0x396f96/0x000068
#: slot/0x003af9cd/0x6270d3/0x00000f
msgid "What's that?"
msgstr "那是什么？"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003af98d/0x226f93/0x000000
msgid "This is the one. "
msgstr "就是这辆。"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003af98d/0x226f93/0x000001
msgid "The exhaust's still warm."
msgstr "排气管还是热的。"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003af98d/0x226f93/0x000002
msgid "...But the cargo's already been offloaded."
msgstr "……但货物已经卸走了。"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003af98d/0x226f93/0x000003
#: slot/0x003af992/0x226fab/0x000001
msgid "Nothing."
msgstr "什么都没有。"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003af98d/0x226f93/0x000005
msgid "Where are they?"
msgstr "他们在哪？"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003af98d/0x226f93/0x000006
msgid "Ahhh..."
msgstr "啊啊……"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003af98d/0x226f93/0x000007
#: slot/0x003af992/0x226fab/0x000005
msgid "Metal...Gear..."
msgstr "合金……装备……"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003af98d/0x226f93/0x000008
msgid "SUN LIGHT!"
msgstr "阳光！"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003af98d/0x226f93/0x000009
#: slot/0x003af992/0x226fab/0x000007
msgid "Mr. Kojima!"
msgstr "小岛先生！"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003af98d/0x326f75/0x000000
msgid ""
"Kaz, I'm inside the facility. \n"
"There's rows and rows of trucks here."
msgstr ""
"卡兹，我进到工厂里了。\n"
"这里停着一排排的卡车。"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003af98d/0x326f75/0x000001
msgid ""
"If that's where they brought the nukes, \n"
"then the truck we're after should be there. "
msgstr ""
"如果核弹被运到了这里，\n"
"那我们要找的卡车应该就在。"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003af98d/0xa26f77/0x000000
msgid ""
"Snake, can you tell which one of \n"
"the trucks brought the nukes? "
msgstr ""
"SNAKE，你能分辨出是哪辆\n"
"卡车运来了核弹吗？"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003af98d/0xa26f77/0x000001
msgid ""
"One of them must have the same license plate \n"
"as the one from the terminal."
msgstr ""
"其中一辆的车牌一定和\n"
"终端那辆一样。"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003af992/0x226fab/0x000000
msgid "Damn it! You found me!"
msgstr "该死！你找到我了！"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003af992/0x226fab/0x000004
msgid "Ahhh... "
msgstr "啊啊……"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003af992/0x226fab/0x000006
msgid "SUN LIGHT"
msgstr "阳光"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003af992/0x326f89/0x000000
msgid ""
"Kaz, I'm inside the facility.\n"
"There're rows and rows of trucks here."
msgstr ""
"卡兹，我进到工厂里了。\n"
"这里停着一排排的卡车。"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003af992/0x326f89/0x000001
msgid ""
"Zadornov should be somewhere in that area. \n"
" Find him."
msgstr ""
"扎多尔诺夫就在那片区域。\n"
"找到他。"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003af9ad/0x227036/0x000000
msgid "You used me."
msgstr "你利用了我。"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003af9ad/0x227036/0x000001
msgid ""
"We used each other. \n"
"I'll get my old Director's job back at headquarters,"
msgstr ""
"我们互相利用。\n"
"我会回总部官复原职，"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003af9ad/0x227036/0x000002
msgid ""
"and you'll finally be able to \n"
"\"walk tall\" among your colleagues."
msgstr ""
"而你终于能在同事中\n"
"\"昂首挺胸\"了。"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003af9ad/0x227036/0x000003
msgid "Rgh... I won't let you get away with this!"
msgstr "呃……我不会让你得逞的！"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003af9ad/0x227036/0x000004
msgid ""
"How unfortunate.\n"
"Guess I'll just have to take your \"legs\" for myself!"
msgstr ""
"真遗憾。\n"
"那我只好夺走你的\"腿\"了！"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003af9ad/0x326ff5/0x000000
msgid "Just a minute! This isn't what we agreed on!"
msgstr "等等！这跟我们说好的不一样！"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003af9ad/0x326ff5/0x000001
msgid ""
"It's too late. \n"
"The changes have already been finalized."
msgstr ""
"太迟了。\n"
"变更已经敲定了。"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003af9ad/0x326ff5/0x000002
msgid ""
"You told me it was going to be a deterrent,\n"
"that we wouldn't have to launch!"
msgstr ""
"你说过那只是威慑，\n"
"我们不必真的发射！"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003af9ad/0x326ff5/0x000003
msgid ""
"I am not arguing with you, Doctor.\n"
"Our goal is to create the perfect deterrent."
msgstr ""
"我不是跟你争，博士。\n"
"我们要造完美威慑。"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003af9ad/0x326ff5/0x000004
msgid "That's why I agreed to help develop it... "
msgstr "所以我才答应帮忙开发的……"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003af9ad/0x326ff5/0x000005
msgid ""
"Mm-hmm. However, in order to achieve\n"
"that perfect deterrent, "
msgstr ""
"嗯哼。不过，要实现\n"
"那完美的威慑，"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003af9ad/0x326ff5/0x000006
msgid "we must show the world our strength."
msgstr "我们必须向世界展示实力。"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003af9ad/0x326ff5/0x000007
msgid ""
"Three key principles ensure effective\n"
"nuclear deterrence."
msgstr ""
"确保有效核威慑的\n"
"三大原则。"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003af9ad/0x326ff5/0x000008
msgid "First, you must have nuclear weapons."
msgstr "第一，必须拥有核武器。"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003af9ad/0x326ff5/0x000009
msgid "Second, you must never use them first."
msgstr "第二，绝不首先使用。"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003af9ad/0x326ff5/0x00000a
msgid "And third, and most important..."
msgstr "第三，最重要……"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003af9ad/0x326ff5/0x00000b
msgid "If someone attacks you, you must strike back."
msgstr "若遭攻击，必须予以反击。"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003af9ad/0x326ff5/0x00000c
msgid ""
"Unless we prove beyond a doubt that these\n"
"three principles work in practice, "
msgstr ""
"除非我们证明这三项原则\n"
"确实行之有效，"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003af9ad/0x326ff5/0x00000d
msgid "the world will not accept our new deterrent."
msgstr "否则世界不接受新威慑。"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003af9ad/0x326ff5/0x00000e
msgid "And the only way to do that "
msgstr "而唯一的办法"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003af9ad/0x326ff5/0x00000f
msgid ""
"is to show them we're capable of\n"
"actually launching a nuke."
msgstr ""
"就是让他们看到我们\n"
"真能发射核弹。"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003af9ad/0x427058/0x000000
msgid "W-wait!"
msgstr "等、等等！"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003af9ad/0x427058/0x000001
msgid "Hey, you OK?"
msgstr "喂，你没事吧？"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003af9ad/0x427058/0x000002
msgid "Don't do it..!"
msgstr "别这样！"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003af9ad/0x427058/0x000003
msgid "Snap out of it! Where are the nukes?"
msgstr "清醒点！核弹在哪？"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003af9ad/0x427058/0x000004
msgid "He's going to do it!"
msgstr "他真要动手！"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003af9ad/0x52701a/0x000000
msgid ""
"Your creation? That thing wasn't\n"
"even your idea to begin with."
msgstr ""
"你的作品？那东西一开始\n"
"就不是你的主意。"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003af9ad/0x52701a/0x000001
msgid "You stole it, didn't you?"
msgstr "是你偷的，对吧？"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003af9ad/0x52701a/0x000002
msgid "...S-stole it? You're one to talk! "
msgstr "……偷的？你还有脸说！"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003af9ad/0x52701a/0x000003
msgid ""
"You got the idea for bipedal locomotion\n"
"from the Communists in the first place!"
msgstr ""
"双足行走的点子\n"
"本来就是从共产党那里弄来的！"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003af9ad/0x52701a/0x000004
msgid "You listen to me, doc! Keep quiet. Do as I say. "
msgstr "听我说，博士！闭嘴。照我说的做。"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003af9ad/0x52701a/0x000005
msgid "And not another word about stolen ideas."
msgstr "不许再提偷点子的事。"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003af9ad/0x52701a/0x000006
msgid ""
"Should we succeed here, you'll be the toast \n"
"of the scientific community..."
msgstr ""
"只要这里成功，你就是科学界的\n"
"风云人物……"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003af9ad/0x52701a/0x000007
msgid "...And your name'll go down in history"
msgstr "……你的名字将载入史册"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003af9ad/0x52701a/0x000008
msgid ""
"as champion of both progress \n"
"and national security!"
msgstr ""
"成为进步与国家安全的\n"
"双重捍卫者！"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003af9ad/0x52701a/0x000009
msgid "The hell with that!"
msgstr "去他的！"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003af9ad/0x52701a/0x00000a
msgid "Doctor!"
msgstr "博士！"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003af9ad/0x52701a/0x00000b
msgid "Unless we prove we're capable of launching, "
msgstr "除非我们证明有能力发射，"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003af9ad/0x52701a/0x00000c
msgid "Peace Walker is useless as a deterrent."
msgstr "和平行者作为威慑毫无用处。"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003af9ad/0x62705a/0x000000
msgid "He's gonna launch a nuke!"
msgstr "他要发射核弹！"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003af9ad/0x927011/0x000000
msgid ""
"But... isn't deterrence supposed \n"
"to stop nukes from being used...!"
msgstr ""
"可是……威慑不就是为了\n"
"阻止核弹被使用吗……！"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003af9ad/0x927011/0x000001
msgid ""
"Exactly. And so the one we launch \n"
"will be the last one ever!"
msgstr ""
"没错。我们发射的\n"
"将是史上最后一枚！"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003af9ad/0x927011/0x000002
msgid "I won't let you use my creation like that!"
msgstr "我不会让你那样用我的作品！"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003af9ad/0xa27054/0x000000
msgid "...Peace won't just come to us, doc."
msgstr "……和平不会自己找上门，博士。"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003af9ad/0xa27054/0x000001
msgid "We are going to have to go meet it halfway."
msgstr "我们得主动迎上去。"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003af9ad/0xa27054/0x000002
msgid "V for victory."
msgstr "V代表胜利"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003af9cd/0x327091/0x000000
msgid ""
"That was an unmanned weapon... a prototype. \n"
"I made it myself."
msgstr ""
"那是个无人兵器……原型机。\n"
"是我亲手做的。"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003af9cd/0x327091/0x000002
msgid "I work here. Well, used to, anyway. Name's Huey."
msgstr "我在这里工作。不过以前是。我叫休伊。"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003af9cd/0x327091/0x000003
msgid ""
"And who might you be? \n"
"You don't look like one of those mercenaries."
msgstr ""
"你是哪位？\n"
"看起来不像那些雇佣兵。"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003af9cd/0x327091/0x000004
msgid "Me? I'm... an entomologist."
msgstr "我？我是……昆虫学家。"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003af9cd/0x327091/0x000005
msgid "A... fighting... entomologist?"
msgstr "一个……战斗……昆虫学家？"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003af9cd/0x327091/0x000006
msgid ""
"I specialize in butterflies.\n"
"I'm, here to catch a Ulysses..."
msgstr ""
"我专攻蝴蝶。\n"
"我来抓尤利西斯……"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003af9cd/0x327091/0x000007
msgid ""
"Ulysses? Hmm, \n"
"I didn't think they lived in Costa Rica."
msgstr ""
"尤利西斯？嗯，\n"
"我不觉得它们会住在哥斯达黎加。"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003af9cd/0x327091/0x000008
msgid "...Morphos, maybe?"
msgstr "……也许是摩尔福斯？"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003af9cd/0x327091/0x000009
msgid ""
"That's it.. Need to get some before \n"
"the Washington Treaty goes into effect..."
msgstr ""
"对，就是它……得赶在华盛顿条约\n"
"生效前抓几只……"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003af9cd/0x327091/0x00000a
msgid ""
"Says here Morphos aren't covered \n"
"under the treaty..."
msgstr ""
"这说摩尔福斯\n"
"不受条约保护……"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003af9cd/0x327091/0x00000b
msgid "Ugh... Must have slipped my mind."
msgstr "呃……我一定是忘了。"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003af9cd/0x327091/0x00000c
msgid "You sure you're feeling all right?"
msgstr "你确定你没事吗？"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003af9cd/0x327162/0x000000
msgid "Our place is \"Outer Heaven.\" You'd fit right in."
msgstr "我们的地盘叫“世外天堂”。你会很适应的。"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003af9cd/0x327162/0x000001
msgid "Outer Heaven... ?"
msgstr "世外天堂……？"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003af9cd/0x327162/0x000003
msgid ""
"I'm probably better suited to \n"
"something like that than this \"paradise.\""
msgstr ""
"比起这个“天堂”，\n"
"我大概更适合那种地方。"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003af9cd/0x327162/0x000004
msgid "Good. You get a free balloon trip for signing up."
msgstr "很好。报名就送免费热气球之旅。"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003af9cd/0x327162/0x000005
msgid "Enjoy it, you'll feel like a butterfly."
msgstr "享受吧，你会像蝴蝶。"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003af9cd/0x327162/0x000006
msgid "You're an agent, right? Who do you work for?"
msgstr "你是特工吧？替谁干活？"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003af9cd/0x327162/0x000007
msgid "Me? I was a Cold War tool, same as you."
msgstr "我？和你一样，冷战工具。"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003af9cd/0x327162/0x000008
msgid ""
"Now I'm not so useful anymore, so they \n"
"cut me loose... I don't answer to anyone."
msgstr ""
"现在我没用了，他们\n"
"就甩了我……我不听谁的。"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003af9cd/0x327162/0x000009
msgid "...Call me Snake."
msgstr "……叫我SNAKE。"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003af9cd/0x327162/0x00000a
msgid "Snake... The name seems familiar somehow."
msgstr "SNAKE……这名字好像在哪听过。"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003af9cd/0x327162/0x00000b
msgid "Probably just déjà vu."
msgstr "大概是既视感吧。"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003af9cd/0x327162/0x00000c
msgid "...You see that there?"
msgstr "……你看到那边了吗？"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003af9cd/0x327162/0x00000d
msgid "Beyond the cloud forest. See those ruins?"
msgstr "云雾林那边。看到废墟没？"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003af9cd/0x327162/0x00000f
msgid "That's where you'll find Dr. Strangelove's lab."
msgstr "斯特兰奇洛夫博士实验室就在那。"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003af9cd/0x4270fe/0x000000
msgid "There's the chance that a pre-emptive strike could destroy all the missile bases"
msgstr "先发制人的打击有可能摧毁所有导弹基地"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003af9cd/0x4270fe/0x000001
msgid "... Render them unable to retaliate."
msgstr "……让他们无法反击。"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003af9cd/0x4270fe/0x000002
msgid ""
"But the biggest flaw in the theory is \n"
"that the decision to retaliate"
msgstr ""
"但这个理论最大的漏洞在于，\n"
"决定是否反击的"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003af9cd/0x4270fe/0x000003
msgid "has to be made by human beings."
msgstr "必须是人。"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003af9cd/0x4270fe/0x000004
msgid "Let me give you a real-world example."
msgstr "给你举个现实例子。"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003af9cd/0x4270fe/0x000005
msgid ""
"Let's say Country X launches first \n"
"against Country Y..."
msgstr ""
"假设X国率先对Y国\n"
"发动攻击……"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003af9cd/0x4270fe/0x000006
msgid ""
"If the people in charge \n"
"in Country Y are like you and me,"
msgstr ""
"如果Y国的决策者\n"
"和你我一样，"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003af9cd/0x4270fe/0x000007
msgid "they're not gonna be able to retaliate"
msgstr "他们不会发动反击，"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003af9cd/0x4270fe/0x000008
msgid ""
"knowing that they're \n"
"effectively ending all human life. "
msgstr ""
"因为他们知道那等于\n"
"终结全人类的生命。"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003af9cd/0x4270fe/0x000009
msgid "So then..."
msgstr "那么…"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003af9cd/0x4270fe/0x00000a
msgid "the weak link in nuclear deterrence theory is the uncertainty of retaliation?"
msgstr "核威慑理论的薄弱环节就是反击的不确定性？"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003af9cd/0x4270fe/0x00000b
msgid "Bingo."
msgstr "答对了。"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003af9cd/0x4270fe/0x00000c
msgid ""
"And that creates a \"loophole\" Country X \n"
"can exploit to launch the first strike."
msgstr ""
"这就制造了一个X国\n"
"可以利用来发动首轮攻击的“漏洞”。"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003af9cd/0x4270fe/0x00000d
msgid ""
"...Which is why we designed the system\n"
"to be unmanned."
msgstr ""
"……所以系统\n"
"才设计成无人。"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003af9cd/0x4270fe/0x00000e
msgid "With Peace Walker, retaliation is certain."
msgstr "有了和平行者，反击是必然的。"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003af9cd/0x4270fe/0x00000f
msgid ""
"It chooses the appropriate target \n"
"and launches a retaliatory nuclear strike"
msgstr ""
"它会选择合适的\n"
"目标并发动核反击，"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003af9cd/0x4270fe/0x000010
msgid ""
"every time, without needing human input\n"
"to make the call."
msgstr ""
"每次都是如此，无需人类\n"
"来做决定。"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003af9cd/0x4270fe/0x000011
msgid "Launching a nuclear strike against Peace Walker"
msgstr "对和平行者发动核打击"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003af9cd/0x4270fe/0x000012
msgid ""
"is tantamount to pushing the launch button\n"
"against yourself."
msgstr ""
"就等于按下对准自己的\n"
"发射按钮。"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003af9cd/0x42715b/0x000000
msgid "Strangelove was recruited from the States, too."
msgstr "斯特兰奇洛夫也是从美国招来的。"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003af9cd/0x42715b/0x000001
msgid ""
"In the field of AI, \n"
"there's no one better, that's for sure,"
msgstr ""
"在AI领域，\n"
"没人比她更强，这点毋庸置疑，"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003af9cd/0x42715b/0x000002
msgid ""
"but, man, what a basket case! \n"
"She hates EVERYBODY."
msgstr ""
"但是，天哪，她真是个神经病！\n"
"她讨厌所有人。"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003af9cd/0x42715b/0x000003
msgid ""
"Go to the lab and \n"
"destroy Peace Walker's cerebrum."
msgstr ""
"去实验室，\n"
"摧毁和平行者的大脑。"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003af9cd/0x42715b/0x000004
msgid ""
"I'm pretty sure they haven't finished\n"
"the final calibrations yet."
msgstr ""
"我敢肯定他们还没完成\n"
"最后的校准。"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003af9cd/0x42715b/0x000005
msgid ""
"I'll lend you my ID card. \n"
"It'll get you through security at the lab."
msgstr ""
"我把ID卡借给你。\n"
"它能让你通过实验室的安检。"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003af9cd/0x42715b/0x000006
msgid "Oh... And one more thing..."
msgstr "哦…还有件事…"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003af9cd/0x42715b/0x000007
msgid "What's this? A letter of recommendation?"
msgstr "这是什么？推荐信？"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003af9cd/0x42715b/0x000008
msgid "Yeah, it's, um... it's from me to Dr. Strangelove."
msgstr "对，是，呃……是我写给斯特兰奇洛夫博士的。"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003af9cd/0x42715b/0x000009
msgid "...Don't read it, OK?"
msgstr "……别看，好吗？"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003af9cd/0x42715b/0x00000a
msgid "So what will you do now?"
msgstr "那你怎么办？"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003af9cd/0x42715b/0x00000b
msgid "I... I'm done with science."
msgstr "我……我不搞科学了。"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003af9cd/0x42715b/0x00000c
msgid ""
"At this rate, I'm probably already \n"
"halfway to hell anyway."
msgstr ""
"照这样，我大概已经\n"
"半只脚踏进地狱了。"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003af9cd/0x42715b/0x00000d
msgid "Not so fast. Why not join us?"
msgstr "别急。加入我们吧？"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003af9cd/0x527099/0x000000
msgid "Anyway, long story short, the butterfly got away."
msgstr "总之，长话短说，蝴蝶跑了。"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003af9cd/0x527099/0x000001
msgid ""
"So how about it, doc? \n"
"Did you make that big \"butterfly\" too?"
msgstr ""
"那么，博士？\n"
"那只大“蝴蝶”也是你造的吗？"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003af9cd/0x527099/0x000002
msgid "Yes... "
msgstr "是……"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003af9cd/0x527099/0x000003
msgid "and no."
msgstr "也不是。"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003af9cd/0x527099/0x000004
msgid "What was that thing? What are they doing here?"
msgstr "那是什么？他们来干嘛？"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003af9cd/0x527099/0x000005
msgid ""
"Hmh. Something tells me \n"
"you're no ordinary entomologist."
msgstr ""
"哼。我总觉得\n"
"你不是普通的昆虫学家。"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003af9cd/0x527099/0x000006
msgid "The nukes were loaded on that machine."
msgstr "核弹被装上了那台机器。"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003af9cd/0x527099/0x000007
msgid "The project's entering its final phase."
msgstr "计划已进入最终阶段。"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003af9cd/0x527099/0x000008
msgid "Project...?"
msgstr "计划……？"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003af9cd/0x527099/0x000009
msgid "That's right."
msgstr "没错。"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003af9cd/0x527099/0x00000a
msgid "The thermonuclear warheads they brought in,"
msgstr "他们运来的热核弹头，"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003af9cd/0x527099/0x00000b
msgid "the bases scattered throughout Costa Rica,"
msgstr "遍布哥斯达黎加的基地，"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003af9cd/0x527099/0x00000c
msgid ""
"the mercenaries, the AI weapons, \n"
"the research we were conducting here..."
msgstr ""
"雇佣兵、AI武器、\n"
"我们在这里进行的研究……"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003af9cd/0x527099/0x00000d
msgid "It's all for this..."
msgstr "全都是为了这个……"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003af9cd/0x6270d3/0x000000
msgid ""
"They're going to deploy \n"
"a new type of nuclear weapon"
msgstr ""
"他们将要部署 \n"
"一种新型核武器"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003af9cd/0x6270d3/0x000001
msgid "along the Caribbean coast of Latin America."
msgstr "部署一种新型核武器。"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003af9cd/0x6270d3/0x000002
msgid "A mobile, unmanned nuclear platform."
msgstr "一种可移动的无人核平台。"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003af9cd/0x6270d3/0x000003
msgid "Unmanned... nuclear platform...?"
msgstr "无人……核平台……？"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003af9cd/0x6270d3/0x000004
msgid ""
"A fail-deadly system that can \n"
"automatically move into position"
msgstr ""
"一种失效即致命的系统，可以 \n"
"自动移动到指定位置"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003af9cd/0x6270d3/0x000005
msgid "and launch a retaliatory nuclear strike."
msgstr "并发动报复性核打击。"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003af9cd/0x6270d3/0x000006
msgid "It can move on its own,"
msgstr "它能自行移动，"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003af9cd/0x6270d3/0x000007
msgid ""
"and stealth shields it from radar\n"
"and satellite detection,"
msgstr ""
"且隐形设计使其能躲过雷达\n"
"与卫星探测，"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003af9cd/0x6270d3/0x000008
msgid ""
"drastically reducing the risk of it being \n"
"destroyed in a pre-emptive strike."
msgstr ""
"大幅降低遭先发制人打击\n"
"摧毁的风险。"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003af9cd/0x6270d3/0x000009
msgid "And this is the new deterrent?"
msgstr "这就是新的威慑力量？"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003af9cd/0x6270d3/0x00000a
msgid ""
"Supposed to be. \n"
"The problem is the locomotion system."
msgstr ""
"本该如此。\n"
"问题出在移动系统上。"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003af9cd/0x6270d3/0x00000b
msgid ""
"There's no dry season in the Caribbean. \n"
"It rains all year round."
msgstr ""
"加勒比没有旱季。\n"
"全年都在下雨。"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003af9cd/0x6270d3/0x00000c
msgid "The terrain is full of tropical rainforest..."
msgstr "地形遍布热带雨林……"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003af9cd/0x6270d3/0x00000d
msgid ""
"A lot of the time \n"
"you can't even build a proper road."
msgstr ""
"很多时候\n"
"连像样的路都修不了。"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003af9cd/0x6270d3/0x00000e
msgid "...So I went back to where it all started."
msgstr "……于是我回到了最初的起点。"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003af9cd/0x6270d3/0x000010
msgid "Legs. Walking power."
msgstr "腿。行走能力。"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003af9cd/0x6cdb3a/0x000000
msgid ""
"A mobile launcher carrying a thermonuclear \n"
"warhead even more powerful"
msgstr ""
"一台移动发射平台，搭载的热核\n"
"弹头威力甚至超过"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003af9cd/0x6cdb3a/0x000001
msgid ""
"than the Soviet RDS-220's (Tsar Bomba). \n"
"That's Peace Walker."
msgstr ""
"苏联RDS-220（沙皇炸弹）。\n"
"这就是和平行者。"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003af9cd/0x6cdb3a/0x000002
msgid "Chico's basilisco..."
msgstr "奇科的蛇怪…"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003af9cd/0x6cdb3a/0x000003
msgid "We did the assembly and field testing here."
msgstr "组装和实地测试都在这做的。"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003af9cd/0x6cdb3a/0x000004
msgid "A walking nuke..."
msgstr "行走核弹…"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003af9cd/0x6cdb3a/0x000005
msgid ""
"I sort of borrowed the original idea \n"
"from behind the Iron Curtain..."
msgstr ""
"我算是从铁幕背后\n"
"借来了最初的点子……"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003af9cd/0x6cdb3a/0x000006
msgid "The missing link between infantry and artillery."
msgstr "步兵与火炮之间缺失的一环。"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003af9cd/0x6cdb3a/0x000007
#: slot/0x003af9cd/0x6cdb3a/0x000008
msgid "Metal Gear..."
msgstr "合金装备……"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003af9cd/0x82713a/0x000000
msgid ""
"It's kind of a hike. And besides, \n"
"there's a sure fire way to halt the project... "
msgstr ""
"路可不近。而且，\n"
"有个万无一失的办法能中止这个项目……"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003af9cd/0x82713a/0x000001
msgid "You see, Peace Walker... isn't quite finished yet."
msgstr "你看，和平行者……还没完全完工。"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003af9cd/0x82713a/0x000002
#: slot/0x003b054d/0x33d29e/0x0000ab
#: slot/0x00db94df/0xb5f44d/0x000000
msgid "What do you mean?"
msgstr "什么意思？"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003af9cd/0x82713a/0x000003
msgid "It's missing one last critical structural component:"
msgstr "它还缺最后一个关键结构部件："

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003af9cd/0x82713a/0x000004
msgid "the AI."
msgstr "AI。"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003af9cd/0x82713a/0x000005
msgid "Its brain."
msgstr "它的大脑。"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003af9cd/0x82713a/0x000006
msgid ""
"The Reptile Pod, \n"
"the electronic brain I was working on,"
msgstr ""
"爬虫舱，\n"
"我一直在研发的电子脑，"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003af9cd/0x82713a/0x000007
msgid ""
"can only follow commands like \n"
"\"go there, attack that.\""
msgstr ""
"只能执行诸如\n"
"“去那，打那”的命令。"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003af9cd/0x82713a/0x000008
msgid ""
"I guess you could compare it \n"
"to the human cerebellum."
msgstr ""
"我想你可以把它比作\n"
"人类的小脑。"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003af9cd/0x82713a/0x000009
msgid "But for nuclear deterrence to work,"
msgstr "但要让核威慑生效，"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003af9cd/0x82713a/0x00000a
msgid ""
"it must function in place of \n"
"a human decision-maker."
msgstr ""
"它必须代替\n"
"人类决策者发挥作用。"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003af9cd/0x82713a/0x00000b
msgid ""
"It needs something to analyze \n"
"the huge volumes of data coming in"
msgstr ""
"它需要某种东西来分析\n"
"涌入的海量数据"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003af9cd/0x82713a/0x00000c
msgid "and select an appropriate target for retaliation."
msgstr "并选定合适的报复目标。"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003af9cd/0x82713a/0x00000d
msgid "Hence, it needs the high-level decision-making ability of a cerebrum."
msgstr "因此，它需要大脑级别的高级决策能力。"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003af9cd/0x82713a/0x00000e
msgid "The mechanical cerebrum..."
msgstr "机械大脑……"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003af9cd/0x82713a/0x00000f
msgid ""
"The hardware configuration is \n"
"modeled on the human brain,"
msgstr ""
"硬件配置是\n"
"以人脑为模型设计的，"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003af9cd/0x82713a/0x000010
msgid ""
"similar to the pod I worked on... \n"
"but its role is completely different."
msgstr ""
"和我做过的那个舱体相似……\n"
"但作用完全不同。"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003af9cd/0x82713a/0x000011
msgid "Where's it being made?"
msgstr "在哪里制造？"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003af9cd/0x82713a/0x000012
msgid "A research lab to the north."
msgstr "北边的一间研究所。"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003af9cd/0x82713a/0x000013
msgid ""
"An AI expert named Dr. Strangelove is \n"
"developing it. Very hush-hush."
msgstr ""
"AI专家斯特兰奇洛夫博士\n"
"在开发它。极其机密。"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003af9cd/0x82713a/0x000014
msgid "Dr. Strangelove..."
msgstr "斯特兰奇洛夫博士……"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003af9cd/0x9270f6/0x000000
#: slot/0x003af9cd/0xa2711c/0x00000e
#: slot/0x003b054d/0x33d29e/0x000018
msgid "But..."
msgstr "但是……"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003af9cd/0x9270f6/0x000001
msgid "They'd actually need to deploy dozens of them."
msgstr "他们实际得部署几十台。"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003af9cd/0x9270f6/0x000002
msgid ""
"Coldman needs funding for that. \n"
"And to get it, he's planning a test,"
msgstr ""
"科尔德曼需要为此筹款。\n"
"为了拿到钱，他正计划一次试验，"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003af9cd/0x9270f6/0x000003
msgid ""
"which will also serve as a demonstration \n"
"for the folks back at Langley."
msgstr ""
"这也将作为一次演示\n"
"给兰利的人看。"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003af9cd/0x9270f6/0x000004
msgid ""
"Wait. He's launching a nuke to prove \n"
"that his perfect deterrent works?"
msgstr ""
"等等。他要发射核弹来证明\n"
"他那完美威慑有效？"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003af9cd/0x9270f6/0x000005
msgid ""
"In his words, \"to prove that if someone \n"
"attacks us, we will strike back.\""
msgstr ""
"用他的话说，“证明谁攻击我们，\n"
"我们就还击。”"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003af9cd/0x9270f6/0x000006
msgid ""
"Put simply, nuclear deterrence is the idea \n"
"of using nukes to keep nukes in check."
msgstr ""
"简单说，核威慑就是用核武\n"
"来制约核武的理念。"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003af9cd/0x9270f6/0x000007
msgid "If one side launches nuclear weapons,"
msgstr "若一方发射核武器，"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003af9cd/0x9270f6/0x000008
msgid "the other is sure to launch theirs in retaliation."
msgstr "另一方必定发射核武报复。"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003af9cd/0x9270f6/0x000009
msgid ""
"Which makes launching an act of suicide. \n"
"In the end, neither side can use its nukes."
msgstr ""
"这让发射等于自杀。\n"
"最终双方都无法动用核武。"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003af9cd/0x9270f6/0x00000a
msgid "It's thanks to this doctrine that"
msgstr "正因这一理论，"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003af9cd/0x9270f6/0x00000b
msgid ""
"the world's two superpowers \n"
"have avoided all-out confrontation."
msgstr ""
"世界两大超级大国\n"
"才避免了全面冲突。"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003af9cd/0x9270f6/0x00000c
msgid "Nuclear deterrence has brought us peace."
msgstr "核威慑为我们带来了和平。"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003af9cd/0x9270f6/0x00000d
msgid ""
"At the very least, it's prevented another \n"
"World War from breaking out."
msgstr ""
"至少，它阻止了另一场\n"
"世界大战的爆发。"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003af9cd/0x9270f6/0x00000e
msgid ""
"But the theory of nuclear deterrence \n"
"exists only on paper."
msgstr ""
"但核威慑理论\n"
"只存在于纸面上。"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003af9cd/0x9270f6/0x00000f
msgid ""
"In reality, there's no guarantee that either side \n"
"would follow through with retaliation."
msgstr ""
"现实中，无法保证任何一方\n"
"会真正实施报复。"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003af9cd/0xa2711c/0x000000
msgid ""
"It closes the loophole \n"
"in nuclear deterrence theory,"
msgstr ""
"它堵上了\n"
"核威慑理论的漏洞，"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003af9cd/0xa2711c/0x000001
msgid ""
"rendering our friends in Country X \n"
"completely unable to launch."
msgstr ""
"让X国的朋友们\n"
"完全无法发射。"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003af9cd/0xa2711c/0x000002
msgid ""
"What Coldman is saying is \n"
"that to achieve this goal,"
msgstr ""
"科尔德曼的意思是，\n"
"要实现这个目标，"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003af9cd/0xa2711c/0x000003
msgid ""
"we need to demonstrate that retaliation \n"
"will be carried out by a machine."
msgstr ""
"我们需要证明报复行动\n"
"将由机器来执行。"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003af9cd/0xa2711c/0x000004
msgid "He will launch his nuke... "
msgstr "他会发射核弹……"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003af9cd/0xa2711c/0x000005
msgid ""
"...And then his version of deterrence \n"
"will be complete."
msgstr ""
"……然后他的威慑理论\n"
"就完整了。"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003af9cd/0xa2711c/0x000006
msgid "And you believe him?"
msgstr "你相信他？"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003af9cd/0xa2711c/0x000007
msgid "...I believe in peace through nuclear deterrence."
msgstr "……我相信通过核威慑实现的和平。"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003af9cd/0xa2711c/0x000008
#: slot/0x00dff0a5/0xa84a6a/0x000006
msgid "Why?"
msgstr "为什么？"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003af9cd/0xa2711c/0x000009
msgid "My father worked on the Manhattan Project."
msgstr "我父亲参与过曼哈顿计划。"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003af9cd/0xa2711c/0x00000a
msgid "He put his whole life into that research..."
msgstr "他把一生都投入了那项研究……"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003af9cd/0xa2711c/0x00000b
msgid ""
"and all it created was this illusion of peace\n"
"called deterrence."
msgstr ""
"而它创造的只是名为威慑的\n"
"和平幻象。"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003af9cd/0xa2711c/0x00000c
msgid "And then I was born... unable to walk."
msgstr "我出生了……无法行走。"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003af9cd/0xa2711c/0x00000d
msgid "I had no choice but to face up to the nukes."
msgstr "我别无选择，只能直面核武器。"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003af9cd/0xa2711c/0x00000f
msgid ""
"if they do end up launching, \n"
"it'll all have been for nothing."
msgstr ""
"如果他们真的发射了，\n"
"一切都将白费。"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003af9cd/0xa2711c/0x000010
msgid "They've got to be stopped."
msgstr "必须阻止他们。"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003af9cd/0xa2711c/0x000011
msgid "Where'd they take the warheads?"
msgstr "弹头被带去哪了？"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003af9cd/0xa2711c/0x000012
msgid ""
"To a base near the border. \n"
"The final test is five days from now."
msgstr ""
"边境附近的一个基地。\n"
"最终测试在五天后。"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003af9cd/0xa2711c/0x000013
msgid "Where's the base?"
msgstr "基地在哪？"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003af9cd/0xa2711c/0x000014
msgid "You're gonna stop them?"
msgstr "你要阻止他们？"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003af9cd/0xb270b4/0x000000
msgid ""
"We used this facility \n"
"to develop unmanned weapons."
msgstr ""
"我们曾用这座设施\n"
"研发无人武器。"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003af9cd/0xb270b4/0x000001
msgid "Unmanned?"
msgstr "无人的？"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003af9cd/0xb270b4/0x000002
msgid "Robots. The one you just fought was a Pupa."
msgstr "机器人。你刚打的是蛹。"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003af9cd/0xb270b4/0x000003
msgid ""
"There's also a flying type called Chrysalis, \n"
"and a treaded type... the Cocoon."
msgstr ""
"还有飞行型的蝶蛹，\n"
"和履带型的……茧。"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003af9cd/0xb270b4/0x000004
msgid ""
"Motor control, target detection, \n"
"tracking, attack, capture,"
msgstr ""
"马达控制、目标探测、\n"
"追踪、攻击、捕获，"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003af9cd/0xb270b4/0x000005
msgid ""
"and transport functions are \n"
"all controlled by an electronic brain."
msgstr ""
"以及运输功能\n"
"全由电子脑控制。"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003af9cd/0xb270b4/0x000006
msgid "There's no need for a human pilot."
msgstr "不需要人类驾驶员。"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003af9cd/0xb270b4/0x000007
msgid "They can only follow simple commands, though. "
msgstr "不过它们只能执行简单指令。"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003af9cd/0xb270b4/0x000008
msgid "Why build them here?"
msgstr "为什么在这里造？"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003af9cd/0xb270b4/0x000009
msgid "For the CIA. They invited me here a year ago."
msgstr "为CIA造的。一年前他们请我来的。"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003af9cd/0xb270b4/0x00000a
msgid "That's who that guy was."
msgstr "原来他是CIA的。"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003af9cd/0xb270b4/0x00000b
msgid ""
"The CIA's station chief for Central America. \n"
"Goes by the name of Hot Coldman."
msgstr ""
"CIA驻中美洲站长。\n"
"名叫霍特·科尔德曼。"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003af9cd/0xb270b4/0x00000c
msgid ""
"Apparently he was some sort of hero \n"
"back at the height of the Cold War."
msgstr ""
"据说冷战巅峰时期\n"
"他算是个英雄。"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003af9cd/0xb270b4/0x00000d
msgid "He's the one running the show."
msgstr "这里由他说了算。"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003af9cd/0xb270b4/0x00000e
msgid "We called it the \"Peace Walker Project.\" "
msgstr "我们叫它“和平行者计划”。"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003af9cd/0xb270b4/0x00000f
msgid "Peace Walker..."
msgstr "和平行者……"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003af9ed/0x3270f3/0x000000
msgid "Snake, how's the mule treating you?"
msgstr "SNAKE，骡子还好用吗？"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003af9ed/0x3270f3/0x000001
msgid ""
"At this pace, I should be there \n"
"by tomorrow morning."
msgstr ""
"照这速度，明早\n"
"我就能到。"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003af9ed/0x3270f3/0x000002
msgid ""
"You've got to hurry.\n"
"The AI could be completed any time now."
msgstr ""
"你得抓紧。\n"
"AI随时可能完成。"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003af9ed/0x3270f3/0x000003
msgid "Would be nice to have a guide..."
msgstr "有个向导就好了…"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003af9ed/0x3270f3/0x000004
msgid ""
"Already on it. I've enlisted Paz to help you.\n"
"She knows the jungle pretty well."
msgstr ""
"已经在办了。我让帕兹帮你。\n"
"她很熟悉这片丛林。"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003af9ed/0x3270f3/0x000005
msgid ""
"Snake, I know you're an expert in survival,\n"
"but you need to stay alert."
msgstr ""
"SNAKE，我知道你是生存专家，\n"
"但还是要保持警惕。"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003af9ed/0x3270f3/0x000006
msgid ""
"You're in an ancient jungle so foggy you can\n"
"hardly see the trees. "
msgstr ""
"你身处一片古老丛林，浓雾中\n"
"几乎看不清树木。"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003af9ed/0x3270f3/0x000007
msgid ""
"It is home to 2,500 species of plants,\n"
"including 400 types of orchids."
msgstr ""
"这里栖息着2500种植物，\n"
"包括400种兰花。"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003af9ed/0x3270f3/0x000008
msgid ""
"There are also 500 species of butterflies\n"
"and over 400 species of wild birds. "
msgstr ""
"还有500种蝴蝶\n"
"和400多种野鸟。"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003af9ed/0x3270f3/0x000009
msgid "The bedrock is solid enough "
msgstr "基岩足够坚固"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003af9ed/0x3270f3/0x00000a
msgid ""
"that Mayan ruins have miraculously survived\n"
"centuries of earthquakes. "
msgstr ""
"玛雅遗迹竟奇迹般地挺过了\n"
"数百年的地震。"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003af9ed/0x3270f3/0x00000b
msgid "An AI lab in a Mayan ruin. "
msgstr "玛雅遗迹AI研究所。"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003af9ed/0x72710f/0x000000
msgid "Who'd have thought, eh, Huey?"
msgstr "谁能想到呢，休伊？"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003af9ed/0x72710f/0x000001
msgid ""
"My sentiments exactly. That doesn't\n"
"mean security's any less tight, though. "
msgstr ""
"我完全同意。不过这不\n"
"意味着安保会松懈。"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003af9ed/0x72710f/0x000002
msgid "You still have the ID card I gave you, don't you?"
msgstr "我给你的ID卡还带着吧？"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003af9ed/0x72710f/0x000003
msgid "Got it right here."
msgstr "就在这儿。"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003af9ed/0x72710f/0x000004
msgid ""
"That'll get you through the gate no problem.\n"
"After that, you're on your own."
msgstr ""
"这能让你顺利通过大门。\n"
"之后就得靠你自己了。"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003af9ed/0x72710f/0x000005
msgid ""
"As long as the AI remains unassembled,\n"
"Coldman's plan's on ice."
msgstr ""
"只要AI还未组装完成，\n"
"Coldman的计划就搁置着。"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003af9ed/0x72710f/0x000006
msgid "Ha, ha. What about security inside the lab?"
msgstr "哈哈。研究所里面的警备呢？"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003af9ed/0x72710f/0x000007
msgid "Well, it shouldn't be a problem for you."
msgstr "嗯，对你来说应该不成问题。"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003af9ed/0x72710f/0x000008
msgid "Strangelove demanded that "
msgstr "斯特兰奇洛夫要求"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003af9ed/0x72710f/0x000009
msgid ""
"the security presence inside \n"
"the lab be kept to a minimum."
msgstr ""
"实验室内的\n"
"安保人员保持在最低限度。"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003af9ed/0x72710f/0x00000a
msgid ""
"It's not all good news, Snake.\n"
"Coldman knows we're here. "
msgstr ""
"不全是好消息，Snake。\n"
"Coldman知道我们在这里。"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003af9ed/0x72710f/0x00000b
msgid ""
"He's raised security in the area \n"
"surrounding the lab."
msgstr ""
"他加强了实验室\n"
"周边地区的安保。"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003af9ed/0x72710f/0x00000c
msgid ""
"You'll be seeing a lot of that Chrysalis UAV and\n"
"a bunch of patrol choppers, too."
msgstr ""
"你还会看到很多那架Chrysalis无人机和\n"
"一堆巡逻直升机。"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003af9ed/0x72710f/0x00000d
msgid ""
"There may be scouts \n"
"in the jungle lying in ambush."
msgstr ""
"丛林里可能\n"
"有侦察兵埋伏。"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003af9ed/0x72710f/0x00000e
msgid "As you approach the lab, be extra vigilant."
msgstr "接近研究所时，格外警惕。"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003af9ed/0x72710f/0x00000f
msgid "I'll be careful."
msgstr "我会小心。"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003af9ed/0x827131/0x000000
msgid "They're looking for you. Stay sharp!"
msgstr "他们在找你。打起精神！"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003af9ed/0x827131/0x000001
msgid ""
"Snake, Strangelove's lab is \n"
"a few miles to the north."
msgstr ""
"Snake，Strangelove的实验室\n"
"在北边几英里处。"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003af9ed/0x827131/0x000002
msgid ""
"It won't be long before the AI is complete.\n"
"Don't let that happen!"
msgstr ""
"AI很快就要完成了。\n"
"别让那发生！"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003afd0d/0x227d94/0x000000
msgid "I'm... an ornithologist."
msgstr "我是鸟类学家。"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003afd0d/0x227d94/0x000001
msgid "A poacher...?!"
msgstr "偷猎者……？！"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003afd0d/0x227d94/0x000002
msgid ""
"The gun's for self-defense.\n"
"I'm looking for... that one rare bird... in Costa Rica."
msgstr ""
"枪是用来自卫的。\n"
"我在找……哥斯达黎加的那只稀有鸟……"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003afd0d/0x227d94/0x000003
msgid "Which one? The quetzal?"
msgstr "哪种？凤尾绿咬鹃？"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003afd0d/0x227d94/0x000004
msgid "Right, the quetzal."
msgstr "对，凤尾绿咬鹃。"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003afd0d/0x227db3/0x000000
msgid "I was trying to capture the quetzal's song."
msgstr "我想录凤尾绿咬鹃叫声。"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003afd0d/0x227db3/0x000001
msgid "Making my way through a thicket, I saw immense ruins towering before me...."
msgstr "穿过一片灌木丛，眼前出现了巨大的遗迹……"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003afd0d/0x227db3/0x000005
msgid "You're the one who made the tape?"
msgstr "那盘磁带是你录的？"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003afd0d/0x227dd9/0x000000
msgid ""
"The only thing I was allowed to keep were\n"
"my undergarments... "
msgstr ""
"他们只允许我留下\n"
"贴身衣物……"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003afd0d/0x227dd9/0x000001
msgid "so that I would not be able to escape..."
msgstr "这样我就没法逃走了……"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003afd0d/0x227dd9/0x000002
msgid ""
"And now I am without even \n"
"the means to prove who I am. "
msgstr ""
"如今我连\n"
"证明自己身份的东西都没有了。"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003afd0d/0x227dd9/0x000003
msgid "I will not make it home to Paris like this."
msgstr "这样我回不了巴黎。"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003afd0d/0x227dd9/0x000004
msgid "In that case... come to our place."
msgstr "那来我们那儿吧。"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003afd0d/0x227dd9/0x000005
#: slot/0x00a57090/0x12908e/0x000223
msgid "Huh...?"
msgstr "嗯？"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003afd0d/0x227dd9/0x000006
msgid ""
"You don't need a passport there.\n"
"Don't even need a name."
msgstr ""
"在那里不需要护照。\n"
"连名字都不需要。"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003afd0d/0x227dd9/0x000007
msgid ""
"If you want to go back to Paris,\n"
"we'll take you there, any time."
msgstr ""
"如果你想回巴黎，\n"
"我们随时都能送你去。"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003afd0d/0x227dd9/0x000008
msgid ""
"What I want is a shower, a change of clothes...\n"
"and a cigarette."
msgstr ""
"我想要的是洗个澡、换身衣服……\n"
"还有一根烟。"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003afd0d/0x227dd9/0x000009
msgid "I've got a cigar. It's Cuban."
msgstr "我有雪茄。古巴的。"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003afd0d/0x227dd9/0x00000a
msgid "No French cigarettes? I prefer unfiltered... "
msgstr "没法国烟？我爱无滤嘴……"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003afd0d/0x227dd9/0x00000b
msgid "...Fresh out."
msgstr "……刚抽完。"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003afd0d/0x227dd9/0x00000c
msgid ""
"But come back to my place and you can\n"
"have all the French cigarettes you want."
msgstr ""
"但跟我回去，法国烟你\n"
"想抽多少有多少。"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003afd0d/0x327db5/0x000000
msgid "I am loyal to myself."
msgstr "我只忠于我自己。"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003afd0d/0x327db5/0x000001
msgid "...Who's there?!"
msgstr "……谁？！"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003afd0d/0x327db5/0x000002
msgid "...I was captured by that woman."
msgstr "……我被那女人抓了。"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003afd0d/0x327db5/0x000003
msgid ""
"But she was kind. She gave me food to \n"
"eat and even bathed me herself, each day."
msgstr ""
"但她很善良。她给我吃的，\n"
"甚至每天亲手给我洗澡。"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003afd0d/0x327db5/0x000004
msgid "But, she said I could go home in a month... "
msgstr "但她说我一个月后能回家……"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003afd0d/0x327db5/0x000005
msgid "\"So whatever you do, don't take off the blindfold. "
msgstr "“所以无论如何，都别摘下眼罩。"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003afd0d/0x327db5/0x000006
msgid "Do so, and you will never leave here.\""
msgstr "摘了，你永远别想离开。”"
